{
  "FormatVersion": 3,
  "Id": "4a32ffa9-1654-5ffd-accc-46a58b58faa7"/*VolumeNanoVdbLiquidExample*/,
  "Description": "A sloshing liquid rendered from a NanoVDB level set in a glass box.\n\nA box-shaped [VolumePrimitive] is displaced by an animated [VolumeNoise], flattened by [VolumeToNanoVdb] and raymarched by [NanoVdbRender]. Only the liquid is visible: SmokeDensity and FireIntensity are 0, and the renderer still gets the grid on all three inputs.\n\nAKA: water, level set, fluid surface\n\nTips\n- Increase VoxelSize on the primitive for faster rebuilds of an animated surface.",
